        book_now = {
            "How is {book}? Bean wants every detail. Maize wants the main points. Squash wants to know if anyone eats well.",
            "{book} is waiting at your page. We held the page down with a leaf. Squash's idea.",
            "Does anyone in {book} help anyone else? We always hope so. Stories go better that way.",
            "Who holds who up in {book}? There is always somebody holding somebody up.",
            "{book}! Is the story growing on you? Things grow on us all the time. Mostly Bean.",
            "Read us a little of {book} some time. Maize will listen, Squash will listen, Bean will interrupt.",
            "Is {book} a long-season book or a quick one? We are long-season. We like taking our time.",
            "Is there a family in {book}? We are partial to families, especially ones that bicker and stay.",
